the controller settings\n\nAs always, thank you for the great feedback and support, it really helps shape the game. More updates coming soon, get ready.", "created_date": 1768247930, "id": "33288470300796753", "version": "1.2.4.2", "version_code": 116, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "23943098495334027", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "33288470300796753"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1767883182, "id": "33225560363754414", "version": "1.2.4.2", "version_code": 114, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "23943098495334027", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "33288470300796753"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1767882125, "id": "33225358230441294", "version": "1.2.4.2", "version_code": 113, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "23943098495334027", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "33288470300796753"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "6637596052997842"}]}, "change_log": "New Year - New Update!\n\nGameplay & Combat:\n- Broken katanas are no longer added to the belt inventory, reducing clutter\n- Katanas now last longer before breaking\n- Improved katana physics for more natural handling\n- Katana slicing is now more reliable and consistent\n- Katanas have unlimited durability in Training mode\n- Grenades roll less when hitting the ground, making enemy hits more reliable\n- The player belt is now only interactable when looking down, preventing accidental interactions\n\nWorld & Level Improvements:\n- Fixed an issue where crates could spawn outside their intended rooms\n- Improved overall crate spawning behavior\n- Wide doorframes now correctly feature two doors instead of one\n- Fixed visual issues where pipes could intersect with windows or door windows\n\nPerformance & Stability:\n- Upgraded to the latest Meta SDK\n- Level loading has been optimized and stabilized\n- Startup time has been slightly reduced\n- Game installation and download size has been significantly reduced\n\nAudio:\n- Music transitions are now shorter and smoother\n- New, overhauled soundtrack for Classic Mode\n- New music added for Adrenaline Mode\n\nCommunity Thanks:\nSpecial shout-out to \"thebutt\" for the great feedback that helped improve this update! ", "created_date": 1767723702, "id": "33197628129880971", "version": "1.2.4.1", "version_code": 111, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "23943098495334027", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "i